            "Urge ke time ten ideas yaad nahi aate. Isliye ek short menu pehle se likho: physical, sensory, social, cognitive aur practical categories mein. Physical: walk, stretch, shower. Sensory: cold water on hands, breathing, music. Social: call, shared room, support message. Cognitive: permission thought label, values reminder. Practical: task with clear endpoint, making tea, organising one shelf. Menu ka aim distraction hi nahi; safe state tak time dena aur underlying need address karna hai.",
            "Har activity ko test karo, assume mat karo. Kuch logon ke liye music trigger hai; kuch ke liye shower safe, kuch ke liye privacy increase karta hai. Substance-using friends ke saath ‘just normal hangout’ early recovery mein unsafe ho sakta hai. Sexual compulsion mein erotic content ko ‘distraction’ use karna obviously counterproductive. Menu ko non-triggering, accessible aur values-aligned rakho. Jo kaam kare usse mark karo; jo na kare usse replace karo, not yourself.",
