            "Usne plan banaya: salary ke day unnecessary access reduce; friends se alcohol-free afternoon plan; Friday late night phone outside bedroom; social anxiety ke liye therapist discussion; urge aaye toh ten-minute pause and support text. Perfection immediately nahi aayi, lekin Saturday exhaustion reduce hua aur high-risk windows identifiable ho gayi. Lesson ‘Aman strong ho gaya’ nahi; lesson ‘map specific hua, toh choices visible hui.’ Tumhari chain different hogi. Example ko copy nahi, method use karo.",
