            "Environment change ko relevant rakho. Agar porn late-night phone se hai, toh office chair change karna enough nahi. Agar alcohol home stock se hai, toh unopened stock ka plan clinician ke overall withdrawal plan ke saath banao. Agar friend group use par pressure deta hai, toh contact boundaries central hain. Agar compulsion stress se hai, toh sirf blocker ke saath stress support bhi chahiye. Friction ek layer hai, complete treatment nahi.",
