            "Compulsive porn/sexual scrolling mein app/site blockers, safe-search, reduced recommendations, logged-out state, no saved payment, device outside bedroom, and screen-free wind-down useful barriers ho sakte hain. Blocker ka password kisi trusted adult ke paas ho sakta hai agar tum consensually chahte ho, lekin coercive partner control ya secret surveillance healthy recovery nahi. Privacy aur dignity maintain karo. Work/school device policies follow karo; unsafe bypass tricks ki zaroorat nahi.",
            "Barrier ko trigger chain se match karo. Agar late-night private browsing main route hai, toh daytime blocking alone enough nahi. Agar social-media suggestions entry point hain, toh unfollow/mute/reset recommendations and reduce idle scrolling. Agar alternate device loophole hai, toh environment plan mein woh bhi include karo. Technology fail ho sakti hai; isliye blocker ke saath urge plan, therapy aur emotional coping rakho. ‘Installed = cured’ expectation avoid karo.",
            exercise=("Digital friction review", ["Primary device/app/time kya hai?", "Kaunsa two extra steps create karega?", "Bedroom/work/sleep boundaries kya hongi?", "Consent-based support kis role mein hoga?", "Blocker fail/bypass ho toh safe reset kya hoga?"]),
