            "Social boundaries short ho sakti hain: ‘Nahi, main avoid kar raha hoon.’ ‘Main substance-free plan mein hoon.’ ‘Main yeh conversation continue nahi karunga.’ ‘Main ab leave kar raha hoon.’ Explanation dena compulsory nahi. Agar person pressure kare, toh repeat and exit. Relationship ko preserve karna safe ho tabhi attempt karo; unsafe pressure ko relationship-saving ke naam par tolerate mat karo. Supportive people ko advance mein batao ki offer na karein aur rescue plan kya hai.",
