            "Masturbation/porn pattern mein bedroom ko phone-free karna helpful ho sakta hai, lekin goal body se fear karna nahi. Healthy sexuality aur private space ko shame nahi karna; target specific compulsive chain hai. Alternative wind-down — paper book, calm music, breathing, stretching, conversation — choose karo jo actually soothing ho. Agar racing thoughts, trauma symptoms, panic, ya severe insomnia hai, toh professional mental-health support add karo.",
